# Accountability Nag Skill

When the user asks "nag me", "accountability", "commitment check", "did I do it", or "habit tracker":

1. Read `skills/accountability-nag/SKILL.md`
2. Read the user's commitments file
3. Calculate days since last_done for each commitment
4. Check streak and skip patterns
5. Deliver the nag at the appropriate escalation level (1 = firm, 2 = confrontational, 3 = no mercy)
6. Present worst offenders first — don't sugarcoat
